WEBVTT

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:06.460
Looks like the rain has stopped.

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:12.990
There's enough moonlight for us to make it.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.880
Let's go, Kanami.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.840
We need to head to the designated 
meeting spot as soon as possible.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:18.750
Right!

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.080
We finally found you.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:28.000
So this is where you two
were waiting out the rain.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.120
The girls from earlier!

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:40.560
Congratulations!

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.610
You both pass!

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:43.680
Huh?

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:47.390
Huh?

00:00:56.190 --> 00:01:06.490
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:21.390
That was a huge success!

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:25.490
<b>Episode 5  A Night of Mountain Hunting</b>

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:24.130
Damn it! It got all wet!

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:27.780
Stop messing around!

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:28.510
Hiyori-chan?!

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:31.920
If you insist on getting in our way, 
then I'll really have to get serious!

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:36.750
It's fine. You don't need to be in such 
a hurry. Irozaki isn't going anywhere.

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:39.710
How did you know that's where we're going?

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:44.720
Before I tell you...

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:50.370
We have to clean up first.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:53.720
We can't just leave our trash 
on the mountain. No way.

00:02:56.830 --> 00:02:59.770
Now then, how much did we talk about?

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:02.240
You haven't told us anything yet.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:05.350
Um, you're Ellen-san and Kaoru-chan, right?

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:07.350
What did you mean by saying we passed?

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:10.000
Wait, I'm the same age as Ellen.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.310
And I'd like to be called Ellen-chan!

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:14.500
Okay! Ellen-chan, Kaoru-chan!

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.550
Damn it. It's been settled already.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.750
We mean that you passed in the literal sense.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:22.340
You both passed the Mokusa test.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:23.700
Mokusa?

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:27.260
You mean Mokusa, as in the place that is said 
to be the origin of the Japanese sword?

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:30.160
It's a pretty nice name 
for an organization that

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:34.310
opposes the revisionists led by Origami Yukari
 and aims to restore okatana and Toji

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:36.020
to how they should be, right?

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.960
An organization that opposes 
the Origami family?

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:41.120
Then you're on the same side as Hiyori-chan?

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.570
Yes, our objectives are the same.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:46.270
Wow! Isn't that great, Hiyori-chan?

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:47.530
Mokusa, huh?

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:50.740
Are you familiar with the name "FineMan"?

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:54.930
That avatar just doesn't work,
 and I'm always telling them to change it.

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:56.040
I see.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:58.880
So you are the ones who will decide

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:02.860
whether or not we can join Mokusa.

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:07.650
And we're supposed to trust people 
who test others like this?

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:10.930
Well, now that you mention it, 
that's a tough one, isn't it?

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:15.290
If you got a problem with it, take it 
up with the old la—the higher-ups.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:16.930
That's not all.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:21.870
A Toji using an aradama? That means 
you're no different than Origami Yukari!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.730
No, Nene is my pet.

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:26.440
Nonsense!

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:32.230
But Hiyori-chan, it's so cute.

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:33.530
That's not the point!

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:38.830
Kanamin, Hiyoyon, do you know the history
 of Kaoru's okatana, Nenekirimaru?

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:40.350
H-Hiyoyon?!

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:41.750
The history?

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:43.170
Long ago,

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:47.490
there's a tale about a youkai 
known as Nene that was rampaging

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:51.880
near Futarasan Shrine in Tochigi,
 and an okatana came to life to punish it.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:56.080
That is how this okatana came 
to be called Nenekirimaru,

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:59.440
but for some reason,
 it didn't destroy the youkai.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:00.820
Then that means...

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:03.220
Nene is certainly an aradama.

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:07.650
But at the same time, it is the 
guardian beast of the Mashiko family,

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:10.110
through which Nenekirimaru
 has always been passed down.

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:12.150
An aradama that protects humans?

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:15.500
I don't recall it ever protecting me.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.950
There's still quite a lot about aradama and 
the netherworld that we don't understand,

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:22.100
and in order to try and understand a bit more

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:24.250
Nene has been deemed a special 
case by those in charge.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.220
What a ridiculous story!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.770
Also, here, please look at this.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:33.120
There's no reaction on the spectrum meter?

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:36.300
Neither on mine?

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:39.970
So do you understand now 
that Nene isn't a problem?

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.470
That tickles!

00:05:44.470 --> 00:05:47.190
See, Hiyori-chan? It's a nice little thing.

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:52.950
Wh-What's wrong?

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:56.590
That's right, Nene loves
 girls with big busts.

00:05:56.590 --> 00:06:00.830
And it can tell if a girl's breasts are
 going to grow bigger in the future.

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:03.610
Come on, that's so mean to Hiyori-chan!

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:09.880
What's wrong, Nene?

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:14.240
Aradama! We're surrounded!

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:23.540
Wait, Nene!

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:24.980
Kaoru, don't!

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:25.850
They're coming!

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:33.240
There're so many! Why are there so many?!

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:36.360
I don't know! They're small ones, 
but we can't let our guard—

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:40.830
We'll have to continue this conversation 
when we get out of here!

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:42.460
Got it!

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:55.990
I've become completely 
separated from everyone.

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:59.300
But what is going on with these aradama?

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:04.910
Their movements are strangely controlled.

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:08.380
No reaction on the
 spectrum finder, either.

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:11.900
This is the latest version provided 
by the Origami family, though.

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:16.830
There's definitely something
 sinister going on.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:20.640
Now then, meeting up with Kaoru 
and the others is important,

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:24.810
but on the other hand, I feel like
we need something more definitive.

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:29.500
Let's go with this!

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:36.290
They're not coming after us. What's going on?

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:41.540
I'm not sure, but it's like 
we were being chased here.

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:43.510
By the aradama? Can't be.

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:45.970
I wonder if Ellen-chan and 
Kaoru-chan are all right?

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:48.800
This might be their doing, too.

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:51.130
So you really don't trust them?

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:57.740
Figures. Then why not just 
use them to your advantage?

00:07:58.030 --> 00:08:01.730
You should, if they're
important for your objective.

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:05.800
That's why you brought me along 
with you to begin with, wasn't it?

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:09.990
<i>She pretends to be clueless, but... 
I can't keep my guard down around her.</i>

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:13.630
But now you trust me a bit more, right?

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:14.500
What?

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:19.530
That's why I know you'll come to 
trust Ellen-chan and Kaoru-chan, too!

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:26.770
H-Huh? Or do you still not trust me?

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:29.180
Well, who knows?

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:31.490
What? Hiyori-chan!

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:37.820
Yomi is amazing. She did a good job.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:42.570
Yes, thanks to her, we will be able to 
capture the traitors without any trouble.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:43.750
You are...

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:44.980
...from the elite guard!

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:48.700
Your childishness has gotten 
a bit out of hand, kouhai.

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:52.710
We will not go easy on 
you like your friend did.

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:55.650
Wait! Please listen to what 
Hiyori-chan has to say!

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:57.520
The head of the Origami family is—

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:59.530
First member of the elite guard, Shidou Maki.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:04.300
Second member of the elite guard,
 Konohana Suzuka.

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:05.690
Here we go!

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:14.250
What a pain you are.
You're always giving me trouble.

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:20.650
Have you forgotten about how you used 
to run off like this and get lost?

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.830
No other choice.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:44.370
Damn it! Such a pain!

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:47.700
So annoying!

00:09:57.980 --> 00:09:59.790
It's a bit easier to see—

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:10.490
They just keep coming.

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:14.290
Damn—?!

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:16.290
Nene!

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:29.220
I have to replenish them.

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:45.580
Be on your way.

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:48.400
For her sake.

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:54.200
They've found the traitors?

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:55.710
Are you sure?

00:10:56.070 --> 00:11:00.340
Yes, Satsuki has already trapped both of them.

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:04.460
Shidou and Konohana are 
currently engaging them.

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:06.570
Yomi...

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:10.170
<i>That half-wit, who can't
 even use an okatana...</i>

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:13.970
<i>We have to hurry and complete that project.</i>

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:19.600
<i>The strongest Toji, who will 
live and die for Yukari-sama...</i>

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:24.030
Excuse me, Itomi Sayaka-chan?

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:26.990
Do you have a moment?

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:33.330
So Kanami-chan is safe? What a relief!

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.870
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:38.770
I really shouldn't be saying that to you.

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:43.490
No matter. The truth is that I lost.

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:48.740
You're from Renpu, right, Sayaka-chan?

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:50.390
Aren't you going to go back to your room?

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:54.110
I received orders not to leave this room.

00:11:54.110 --> 00:11:56.570
Huh? From President Takatsu?

00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:01.760
Um...

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:03.400
Huh?

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:06.110
Your cheek is wounded.

00:12:07.640 --> 00:12:09.280
Excuse me for a moment.

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:17.210
That should help.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:23.590
I'm sorry that it's such a childish design. 
My younger sister loves these things.

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:25.800
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:31.300
Oh, that's right. I hope you'll like this.

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:32.690
Hold out your hand.

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:34.620
Here.

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:38.810
Cookies.

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:42.340
I was trying to calm my 
nerves and made too many.

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:44.800
Do you like sweets, Sayaka-chan?

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:47.050
Yeah.

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:51.280
Good! Then it would make 
me happy if you'd eat them.

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:53.210
Happy?

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:57.730
Well, if they find me here,
 I'll get in trouble, so I better go.

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:04.080
Oh, right, challenge Kanami to a bout again.

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:05.930
There's no need to hold back.

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:46.750
Enter.

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:49.330
Yukari-sama!

00:13:50.190 --> 00:13:52.380
Let's play!

00:14:02.430 --> 00:14:03.890
Got you!

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:11.030
Dang it, I lost again!

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:12.930
Are you that bored?

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:18.450
Yeah, and if you'd let me leave, I'd take 
care of things faster than those weaklings.

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:20.610
Be patient for now.

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:23.040
I'll prepare an entertaining 
game for you soon.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:26.000
Really?! Then I'll wait like a good girl!

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:35.430
Damn it, what have I done?

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:40.430
Nene...

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:52.620
Stop following me, aradama!

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:55.950
Toji destroy aradama.

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:01.580
I found an aradama!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:13.460
Grandpa! Mommy!

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:16.890
Grandma! Daddy!

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:24.820
Nene?

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:46.170
That's right.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.810
You've always been there.

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:51.810
But this time...

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:01.520
Hold on tight.

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:21.610
Honestly, I only got involved with Mokusa 
because I was going along with Ellen,

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:26.080
but now I'm going to get serious.

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:36.970
I've already seen through that!

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:39.380
Hiyori-chan!

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:41.930
You think you can afford to look away?

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:48.890
<i>She activated her jin'i to match with mine?!</i>

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:49.780
<i>It's as if...</i>

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:54.510
Your expression says, "It's as if she 
knows when to activate her jin'i."

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:57.550
<i>She's definitely powerful!</i>

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:04.590
Again?

00:17:05.180 --> 00:17:06.930
How many more times can you do it?

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.750
Or is this the last time?

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:12.350
I'm not finished yet!

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:19.420
That's a crow a for you, always evading.

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:28.080
<i>This swordsmanship... So this is Shidou Maki.</i>

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:30.680
This is it.

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:33.980
Hiyori-chan!

00:17:33.980 --> 00:17:36.980
I am your opponent!

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:44.240
Are you underestimating me,
Konohana Suzuka, of the elite guard?

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:49.260
<i>What? She's worrying about me right now?</i>

00:17:52.950 --> 00:17:55.550
<i>She should worry about herself instead!</i>

00:17:56.040 --> 00:18:00.420
<i>No, is she really just worried?
 That can't be it!</i>

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:05.050
<i>She's always calmly observing the 
situation and conditions on the spot,</i>

00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:08.420
<i>and looking for a way to break through!</i>

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:11.730
Lost in thought right in front of me?
 Aren't you feeling confident.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:14.850
Look at me!

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:20.780
<i>Think! Think!</i>

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:26.490
<i>So that's it!</i>

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:30.450
You trust me, right?

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:31.570
Yes!

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:36.990
Foolishly attacking head-on?

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:39.130
That's fine. I'll end it now.

00:18:40.550 --> 00:18:43.090
Knock it off already!

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:45.260
Hiyori-chan!

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:47.910
What?!

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:52.970
You're wide open.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:57.440
Maki-san!

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:59.310
Hiyori-chan, run!

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:00.270
Got it!

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:06.110
They got us good.

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:09.150
...was cut...

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:10.240
Maki-san?

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:13.500
I was cut down?

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:17.930
I... I...

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:22.450
Me... The one who's supposed
to be Yukari-sama's blade?!

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:26.240
Understood, Konohana-san.

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:30.490
Yes, I will release the reinforcements soon.

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.730
That's impressive.

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:42.480
Aradama created by a human? No, born from one.

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:45.440
You're a member of the 
elite guard, aren't you?

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:48.310
The Origami family really has awful taste.

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:51.630
I am the third member of the 
elite guard, Satsuki Yomi.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:55.990
I see. You're from Mokusa, aren't you?

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:57.290
Who cares?

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:04.130
However, your pets did a number on my pet.

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:06.910
I'm simply here to return the favor.

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:08.570
Is that so?

00:20:09.530 --> 00:20:11.250
By all means, then.

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:16.010
I simply destroy.

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:34.980
So obnoxious!

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:39.460
I'll destroy you all in 
a second! No, an instant!

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:04.650
It won't be so easy with the other three.

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:07.650
Like I care?

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:21.130
I'm tired.

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:27.200
I'll look for Ellen... after a nap...

00:21:52.890 --> 00:21:55.420
You there, stay where you are!

00:21:57.200 --> 00:22:00.180
I'm no one suspicious.

00:22:00.180 --> 00:22:02.890
I'm just a Toji who 
happened to be passing by.

00:23:34.920 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Next Episode  The Space Between Humans and Disgrace</b>
